  "body": "Sea views, summer entertaining, kids and pets playing in the big back lawn, and the beach just down the road - this is the kind of lifestyle that's easy to fall in love with. Motivated by a move to Christchurch to be closer to their grandchildren, our sellers are ready to pass on the keys to a lucky new family.\r\n\r\nElevated on an 809sqm section in a peaceful cul-de-sac, just 600 metres from Stanmore Bay Beach, this fantastic family home has plenty to offer. Throw open the bi-fold doors and enjoy effortless indoor-outdoor flow to the sunny, north-facing deck, while the expansive, backyard offers plenty of space to explore the option of adding a pool or landscaped gardens.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Four bedrooms, two bathrooms over two levels\r\n* Primary bedroom includes large walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Refreshed kitchen with gas cooking, double dish drawers and breakfast bar\r\n* Bifold doors open to the large north-facing deck\r\n* Sea views, room to entertain as well as space for a spa pool.\r\n* Wood burner and heat pump keep the living room warm through winter.\r\n* Big, flat backyard with plenty of room for kids, pets or possibly potential for a future pool.\r\n* Backs onto the Whangaparaoa College grounds for an open, green outlook.\r\n* Double garage with internal access, plus a carport and off-street parking.\r\n* Separate laundry.\r\n\r\nStanmore Bay is made for outdoor living, and from this location, so much is right on your doorstep. After-school swims, morning walks and long summer days by the water. The Stanmore Bay Pool & Leisure Centre is an easy stroll, while Whangaparaoa College sits just behind you. Add coastal walkways, local shops and everything else the Whangaparaoa Peninsula has to offer, and you've got a location that's hard to beat.\r\n\r\nSea views, a generous backyard and the beach within walking distance - it's a combination that's becoming harder to find. With Penlink progressing and set to improve connectivity to the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, there's even more to look forward to. If you've been considering a move to this sought-after coastal community, now is a great time to make it happen.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: On site, Wednesday 16th December at 5:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/UQNW\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
